==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 2 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Venusaur Drop Event]], which ran from November 29 to December 13, 2024.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*{{m|Sing}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Jigglypuff}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

